### Response Parameters

{% include '_generic_v4_response.md.j2' %}

#### data

This API returns approval task information only and **returns no execution result**, because the job plan has not been created yet. After the approval is granted, the information of the new job plan can be read from `execute_result` of `/api/v4/get_approval_task` or `/api/v4/refresh_approval_task`.

